# vhs.tape
# Generated by: cue export infra/configs/vhs.cue
# Do not edit manually — edit infra/configs/vhs.cue instead
#
# Usage:
#   vhs vhs.tape                  — render demo.gif
#   vhs vhs.tape --publish        — upload to vhs.charm.sh

# TODO:
# [ ] replace demo script with rice cook {project} showing .rice manifest compilation
#     show a custom/{project}.rice file being written → rice cook compiling in real time
#     show KING routing: rice rule mason → MASON generates config → visible in terminal
# [ ] add separate recordings per command:
#     infra/docs/assets/demo-pour.gif, demo-forge.gif, demo-think.gif, demo-cook.gif
#     referenced from README.md sections, not a single monolithic demo
# [ ] set RICE_VHS_THEME env var — allow per-machine theme override
#     Theme reads from RICE_VHS_THEME (default: "Catppuccin Mocha")
# [ ] automate via pixi task: vhs vhs.tape → triggered by rice audit → docs step
# [ ] add accessibility caption track for demo.mp4 — generated by BARD

# ── output ────────────────────────────────────────────────
Output infra/docs/assets/demo.gif
Output infra/docs/assets/demo.mp4
Output infra/docs/assets/demo.webm

# ── terminal settings ─────────────────────────────────────
Set Shell      "bash"
Set FontSize   14
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set Width      1200
Set Height     600
Set Padding    24
Set Margin     0
Set BorderRadius 8

Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0
Set TypingSpeed   50ms
Set LoopOffset    0%

# ── demo script ───────────────────────────────────────────

# intro
Type "# .rice OS — sovereign enterprise operating system"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 500ms

# pour foundation
Type "rice pour"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "cursor"   # IDE choice
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "cursor-ai"   # AI agent choice
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "skip"     # cloud — skip for demo
Enter
Sleep 3s

# perform machine
Sleep 1s
Type "rice perform"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "auto"     # rendering mode
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "pipewire" # audio profile
Enter
Sleep 3s

# forge environment
Sleep 1s
Type "rice forge"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

# think — detect compute + route models
Sleep 1s
Type "rice think"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "inference"
Enter
Sleep 4s

# rule — KING delegates to MASON
Sleep 1s
Type "rice rule mason \"write infra/configs/cursor.cue\""
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

# rule — KING delegates to CLERK
Sleep 1s
Type "rice rule clerk \"add cargo test for base/mint/lexer\""
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

# audit — full pipeline
Sleep 1s
Type "rice audit"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
Type "commit"
Enter
Sleep 3s

# prepare + cook project
Sleep 1s
Type "rice prepare trading"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "rice cook trading"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

# serve to production
Sleep 1s
Type "rice serve trading"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

# outro
Sleep 1s
Type "# kingdom ready 👑"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 500ms
